test('Worker Passkey并发克隆counter只允许一个会话且零counter凭据保持兼容',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),device=await authenticator(),vaultKey=crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(32)),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};let r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys/registration/options',{method:'POST',body:{},headers}),registration=await r.json();r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys/registration/complete',{method:'POST',headers,body:{challengeId:registration.challengeId,currentPassword:creds.password,vaultKey:toB64(vaultKey),response:await device.registration(registration.publicKey.challenge)}});assert.equal(r.status,201);const options=[];for(let i=0;i<2;i++){r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys/authentication/options',{method:'POST',body:{},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':`203.0.113.${i+1}`}});options.push(await r.json())}const before=e.DB.sessions.length,responses=await Promise.all(options.map(option=>device.authentication(option.publicKey.challenge,1))),results=await Promise.all(options.map((option,i)=>call(e,'/api/passkeys/authentication/complete',{method:'POST',body:{challengeId:option.challengeId,response:responses[i]},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':`198.51.100.${i+1}`}})));assert.deepEqual(results.map(x=>x.status).sort(),[200,400]);assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,before+1);assert.equal(e.DB.passkeyCredentials[0].counter,1);e.DB.passkeyCredentials[0].counter=0;for(let i=0;i<2;i++){r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys/authentication/options',{method:'POST',body:{},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':`192.0.2.${i+1}`}});const option=await r.json();r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys/authentication/complete',{method:'POST',body:{challengeId:option.challengeId,response:await device.authentication(option.publicKey.challenge,0)},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':`192.0.2.${i+10}`}});assert.equal(r.status,200)}assert.equal(e.DB.passkeyCredentials[0].counter,0)});

test('Worker Passkey列表不泄露密钥，撤销要求当前密码并限定当前用户',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id=toB64(crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(24))),other=toB64(crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(24))),userId=e.DB.users[0].id,headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};e.DB.passkeyCredentials.push({id,user_id:userId,public_key:'secret-public-key',counter:0,transports:'["internal"]',device_type:'singleDevice',backed_up:0,server_wrapped_key:'secret-wrapped-key',created_at:10,updated_at:11},{id:other,user_id:'other-user',public_key:'other-key',counter:0,transports:'[]',device_type:'multiDevice',backed_up:1,server_wrapped_key:'other-wrap',created_at:12,updated_at:12});let r=await call(e,'/api/passkeys',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}});assert.equal(r.status,200);const listed=await r.json();assert.deepEqual(listed.credentials,[{id,transports:['internal'],deviceType:'singleDevice',backedUp:false,createdAt:10,updatedAt:11}]);assert.equal(JSON.stringify(listed).includes('secret'),false);r=await call(e,`/api/passkeys/${id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers,body:{currentPassword:'wrong password here'}});assert.equal(r.status,401);assert.equal(e.DB.passkeyCredentials.length,2);r=await call(e,`/api/passkeys/${id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers,body:{currentPassword:creds.password}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{ok:true});assert.deepEqual(e.DB.passkeyCredentials.map(x=>x.id),[other]);r=await call(e,`/api/passkeys/${id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers,body:{currentPassword:creds.password}});assert.equal(r.status,404);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'passkey_not_found'})});

test('Worker 修改主密码时事务撤销Passkey凭据和用户注册challenge',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),userId=e.DB.users[0].id,headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};e.DB.passkeyCredentials.push({id:toB64(crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(24))),user_id:userId,public_key:'key',counter:0,transports:'[]',device_type:'singleDevice',backed_up:0,server_wrapped_key:'wrap',created_at:1,updated_at:1});e.DB.passkeyChallenges.push({id_hash:'owned',user_id:userId,purpose:'registration',challenge:'one',expires_at:Date.now()+10000,created_at:1},{id_hash:'anonymous',user_id:null,purpose:'authentication',challenge:'two',expires_at:Date.now()+10000,created_at:1});const r=await call(e,'/api/change-password',{method:'POST',headers,body:{currentPassword:creds.password,newPassword:'another correct horse',kdf:creds.kdf,wrappedKey:creds.wrappedKey}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.deepEqual(e.DB.passkeyCredentials,[]);assert.deepEqual(e.DB.passkeyChallenges.map(x=>x.id_hash),['anonymous']);assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,0)});

test('Worker 匿名认证 POST 严格要求同源 JSON，拒绝跨站副作用',async()=>{for(const path of ['/api/register','/api/login','/api/passkeys/authentication/options','/api/passkeys/authentication/complete']){let e=env(),r=await call(e,path,{method:'POST',body:{},headers:{origin:'https://evil.test'}});assert.equal(r.status,403,path);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'origin'});assert.equal(e.DB.users.length,0);e=env();r=await call(e,path,{method:'POST',raw:'{}',headers:{origin:'https://vault.test','content-type':'text/plain'}});assert.equal(r.status,415,path);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'unsupported_media_type'});assert.equal(e.DB.users.length,0)}});

test('Worker 注册邀请码关闭、拒绝、持久限速与成功',async()=>{const missing=env();delete missing.INVITE_CODE;let r=await call(missing,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'7.7.7.7'}});assert.equal(r.status,503);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'registration_unavailable'});assert.equal(missing.DB.users.length,0);const e=env();for(let i=0;i<10;i++){r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,inviteCode:'wrong-invite-code-123456789'},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'8.8.8.8'}});assert.equal(r.status,403)}r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'8.8.8.8'}});assert.equal(r.status,429);assert.equal(e.DB.users.length,0);r=await call(env(),'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'9.9.9.9'}});assert.equal(r.status,202);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{ok:true,status:'registration_processed'})});

test('Worker HMAC邀请码仅在服务端pepper正确时注册，并兼容旧SHA摘要',async()=>{const code='hmac-invite-code-123456789',pepper='server-only-pepper-value',key=await crypto.subtle.importKey('raw',new TextEncoder().encode(pepper),{name:'HMAC',hash:'SHA-256'},false,['sign']),signature=await crypto.subtle.sign('HMAC',key,new TextEncoder().encode(code)),stored='hmac-sha256:v1:'+Buffer.from(signature).toString('base64url'),e=env();e.INVITE_CODE_PEPPER=pepper;e.DB.settings.set('invite_code_hash',stored);let r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,inviteCode:code}});assert.equal(r.status,202);const missing=env();missing.DB.settings.set('invite_code_hash',stored);r=await call(missing,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,username:'hmacmissing',inviteCode:code}});assert.equal(r.status,403);const legacy=env();legacy.DB.settings.set('invite_code_hash',Buffer.from(await crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256',new TextEncoder().encode(code))).toString('base64url'));r=await call(legacy,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,username:'legacyinvite',inviteCode:code}});assert.equal(r.status,202)});
test('Worker 43字符base64url环境明文邀请码不被误判为旧摘要',async()=>{const code=Buffer.alloc(32,7).toString('base64url'),e=env();e.INVITE_CODE=code;const r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,username:'env43invite',inviteCode:code}});assert.equal(code.length,43);assert.equal(r.status,202,await r.clone().text())});

test('Worker 注册占用和成功使用统一响应且占用保留限流槽',async()=>{const e=env(),ip='198.51.100.210';let r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':ip}});assert.equal(r.status,202);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{ok:true,status:'registration_processed'});r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':ip}});assert.equal(r.status,202);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{ok:true,status:'registration_processed'});assert.equal(e.DB.attempts.filter(x=>x.key===ip).length,2)});

test('Worker 注册成功与占用对后续限流保持相同序列',async()=>{for(const occupied of [false,true]){const e=env(),ip=occupied?'198.51.100.211':'198.51.100.212';if(occupied)await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds,headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'setup'}});const statuses=[];for(let i=0;i<11;i++){const username=occupied?creds.username:`fresh${i}`;statuses.push((await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:{...creds,username},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':ip}})).status)}assert.deepEqual(statuses,[...Array(10).fill(202),429])}});

test('Worker 并发改密仅一个提交且失败方不撤销成功方状态',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),user=e.DB.users[0],old={hash:user.password_hash,salt:user.password_salt,iterations:user.password_iterations},headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};e.DB.passkeyCredentials.push({id:'pk-race',user_id:user.id});e.DB.passkeyChallenges.push({id_hash:'ch-race',user_id:user.id});let injected=false;e.DB.beforePasswordChange=()=>{if(injected)return;injected=true;Object.assign(user,{password_hash:'peer-hash',password_salt:'peer-salt',password_iterations:200000,kdf:'{"peer":true}',wrapped_key:'{"peer":true}'})};const r=await call(e,'/api/change-password',{method:'POST',body:{currentPassword:creds.password,newPassword:'losing-password',kdf:{salt:'loser',iterations:310000},wrappedKey:{iv:'loser',ciphertext:'loser'}},headers});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'credentials_changed'});assert.equal(user.password_hash,'peer-hash');assert.equal(e.DB.passkeyCredentials.length,1);assert.equal(e.DB.passkeyChallenges.length,1);assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,1);assert.notDeepEqual([user.password_hash,user.password_salt,user.password_iterations],[old.hash,old.salt,old.iterations])});

test('Worker 错密不升级且CAS失败后并发改密不被覆盖',async()=>{const e=env();await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds});const user=e.DB.users[0],legacySalt='legacy-race',legacyHash=await hashPassword(creds.password,legacySalt,100000);Object.assign(user,{password_salt:legacySalt,password_hash:legacyHash,password_iterations:100000});let r=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:'wrong password here'},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'198.51.100.220'}});assert.equal(r.status,401);assert.equal(user.password_hash,legacyHash);const concurrentSalt='concurrent-salt',concurrentHash=await hashPassword('another correct horse',concurrentSalt,200000);e.DB.beforePasswordUpgrade=()=>{Object.assign(user,{password_hash:concurrentHash,password_salt:concurrentSalt,password_iterations:200000});e.DB.beforePasswordUpgrade=null};r=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'198.51.100.221'}});assert.equal(r.status,401);assert.equal(user.password_hash,concurrentHash);assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,0)});

test('Worker 登录完成必须绑定已验证密码世代，改密竞态后不创建会话',async()=>{const e=env();await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds});const user=e.DB.users[0];e.DB.beforeSessionInsert=()=>{e.DB.beforeSessionInsert=null;Object.assign(user,{password_hash:'changed-hash',password_salt:'changed-salt',password_iterations:200000});e.DB.sessions=[]};const r=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'198.51.100.221'}});assert.equal(r.status,401);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'invalid_credentials'});assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,0)});

test('Worker 改用户名完成必须绑定来源会话和已验证密码世代',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),user=e.DB.users[0],headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};e.DB.beforeUsernameChange=()=>{e.DB.beforeUsernameChange=null;Object.assign(user,{password_hash:'changed-hash',password_salt:'changed-salt',password_iterations:200000});e.DB.sessions=[]};const r=await call(e,'/api/change-username',{method:'POST',body:{newUsername:'alice-new',currentPassword:creds.password},headers});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'credentials_changed'});assert.equal(user.username,creds.username)});

test('Worker CAS失败但当前密码仍匹配并发升级哈希时继续登录',async()=>{const e=env();await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds});const user=e.DB.users[0],legacySalt='legacy-ok',legacyHash=await hashPassword(creds.password,legacySalt,100000),peerSalt='peer-salt',peerHash=await hashPassword(creds.password,peerSalt,200000);Object.assign(user,{password_salt:legacySalt,password_hash:legacyHash,password_iterations:100000});e.DB.beforePasswordUpgrade=()=>{Object.assign(user,{password_hash:peerHash,password_salt:peerSalt,password_iterations:200000});e.DB.beforePasswordUpgrade=null};const r=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'198.51.100.222'}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.equal(user.password_hash,peerHash);assert.equal(e.DB.sessions.length,1)});

test('静态资源和 API 都返回生产安全头，匿名分享额外禁止索引',async()=>{const e=env();for(const path of ['/', '/api/health','/share','/share.html']){const r=await call(e,path),csp=r.headers.get('content-security-policy');assert.match(csp,/frame-ancestors 'none'/);assert.match(csp,/script-src 'self'/);assert.match(csp,/img-src 'self' data: blob:/);assert.match(csp,/media-src 'self' blob:/);assert.match(csp,/frame-src 'self' blob:/);assert.doesNotMatch(csp,/script-src[^;]*(?:'unsafe-inline'|'unsafe-eval'|blob:)/);assert.equal(r.headers.get('strict-transport-security'),'max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload');assert.equal(r.headers.get('x-content-type-options'),'nosniff');assert.equal(r.headers.get('x-frame-options'),'DENY');assert.equal(r.headers.get('referrer-policy'),'no-referrer');if(path.startsWith('/share'))assert.equal(r.headers.get('x-robots-tag'),'noindex, nofollow')}});

test('完整认证、会话、CSRF、密文 CRUD、备份和改密流程',async()=>{const e=env();const a=await login(e);assert.equal(typeof a.json.csrf,'string');assert.match(a.json.sessionId,/^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,80}$/);const currentSession=await (await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();assert.equal(currentSession.sessionId,a.json.sessionId);
  assert.deepEqual(a.json.kdf,creds.kdf);assert.deepEqual(a.json.wrappedKey,creds.wrappedKey);assert.equal(typeof e.DB.users[0].kdf,'string');assert.equal(typeof e.DB.users[0].wrapped_key,'string');
  const envelope={id:'entry_123',type:'account',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'opaque-ciphertext'};
  assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/entries/entry_123',{method:'PUT',body:envelope,headers:{cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf}})).status,200);
  const list=await (await call(e,'/api/entries',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();assert.deepEqual(list.items.map(({createdAt,revision,...x})=>x),[envelope]);assert.equal(list.items[0].revision,1);assert.ok(Number.isSafeInteger(list.items[0].createdAt));assert.equal(JSON.stringify(e.DB).includes(creds.password),false);
  const backup=await (await call(e,'/api/backup',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();assert.deepEqual(backup,{version:1,kdf:creds.kdf,wrappedKey:creds.wrappedKey,envelopes:[envelope]});
  assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/backup',{method:'PUT',body:backup,headers:{cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf}})).status,200);
  const changed=await call(e,'/api/change-password',{method:'POST',body:{currentPassword:creds.password,newPassword:'another secure password',kdf:{salt:'new-salt',iterations:310000,hash:'SHA-256'},wrappedKey:{iv:'new-iv',ciphertext:'new-wrap'}},headers:{cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf}});assert.equal(changed.status,200);assert.match(changed.headers.get('set-cookie'),/Max-Age=0/);
  assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/entries/entry_123',{method:'DELETE',headers:{cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf}})).status,401);
});
test('Worker 会话列表记录可信 IP、登录时间和设备类别且不泄露认证哈希',async()=>{const e=env();await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:creds});const first=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'203.0.113.7','user-agent':'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 Version/18.5 Mobile Safari/604.1'}}),firstBody=await first.json(),firstCookie=first.headers.get('set-cookie').split(';')[0];await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password},headers:{'CF-Connecting-IP':'2001:db8::8','user-agent':'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Chrome/126.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'}});const r=await call(e,'/api/sessions',{headers:{cookie:firstCookie}});assert.equal(r.status,200);const value=await r.json();assert.equal(value.sessions.length,2);const current=value.sessions.find(x=>x.current);assert.deepEqual({ip:current.ip,device:current.device,browser:current.browser},{ip:'203.0.113.7',device:'mobile',browser:'safari'});assert.ok(Number.isSafeInteger(current.createdAt));assert.ok(Number.isSafeInteger(current.lastSeenAt));assert.match(current.id,/^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{16,80}$/);assert.equal(JSON.stringify(value).includes('id_hash'),false);assert.equal(JSON.stringify(value).includes('csrf'),false);assert.equal(typeof firstBody.csrf,'string');const currentRow=e.DB.sessions.find(x=>x.public_id===current.id);currentRow.last_seen_at=1;assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:firstCookie}})).status,200);assert.ok(currentRow.last_seen_at>1,'普通认证请求应更新最近活动');const seen=currentRow.last_seen_at;assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:firstCookie}})).status,200);assert.equal(currentRow.last_seen_at,seen,'五分钟内不得重复写最近活动')});
test('Worker 单会话注销和注销其他设备要求 CSRF、隔离账户且保留当前会话',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),otherLogin=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password}}),otherCookie=otherLogin.headers.get('set-cookie').split(';')[0],headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf};let list=await (await call(e,'/api/sessions',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json(),current=list.sessions.find(x=>x.current),other=list.sessions.find(x=>!x.current);assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/sessions/${current.id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers})).status,409);assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/sessions/${other.id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).status,403);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/sessions/not_owned_session_id',{method:'DELETE',headers})).status,404);assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/sessions/${other.id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers})).status,200);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:otherCookie}})).status,401);const third=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password}}),thirdCookie=third.headers.get('set-cookie').split(';')[0];assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/sessions/logout-others',{method:'POST',headers})).status,200);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:thirdCookie}})).status,401);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).status,200);list=await (await call(e,'/api/sessions',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();assert.equal(list.sessions.length,1);assert.equal(list.sessions[0].current,true)});
test('Worker 接受custom密文条目并在备份中原样往返',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},entry={id:'custom_worker1',type:'custom',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'opaque-custom-ciphertext'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/custom_worker1',{method:'PUT',headers,body:entry});assert.equal(r.status,200,await r.clone().text());r=await call(e,'/api/entries',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}});assert.deepEqual((await r.json()).items.map(({id,type,version,iv,ciphertext})=>({id,type,version,iv,ciphertext})),[entry]);const backup=await (await call(e,'/api/backup',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();assert.equal((backup.envelopes||backup.entries).some(x=>x.id===entry.id&&x.type==='custom'&&x.ciphertext===entry.ciphertext),true)});

test('Worker 安全分享创建、列表、原子耗尽和撤销均保持密文边界',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},token='T'.repeat(43),envelope={version:1,iv:toB64(new Uint8Array(12).fill(1)),ciphertext:toB64(new Uint8Array(32).fill(2))},ownerNote={version:1,iv:'A'.repeat(16),ciphertext:'bm90ZQ=='};let r=await call(e,'/api/shares',{method:'POST',headers,body:{token,envelope,ownerNote,expiresAt:Date.now()+60000,maxViews:1}});assert.equal(r.status,201,await r.clone().text());assert.equal(e.DB.secureShares[0].token_hash===token,false);r=await call(e,'/api/shares',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}});const listed=await r.json();assert.equal(listed.shares.length,1);assert.deepEqual(listed.shares[0].ownerNote,ownerNote);r=await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',body:{token}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{envelope});assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',body:{token}})).status,404);const token2='U'.repeat(43);await call(e,'/api/shares',{method:'POST',headers,body:{token:token2,envelope,ownerNote,expiresAt:Date.now()+60000,maxViews:3}});const sharesAfterSecond=(await (await call(e,'/api/shares',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json()).shares,id=sharesAfterSecond.find(x=>x.viewCount===0&&x.maxViews===3).id;assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/${id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers})).status,204);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',body:{token:token2}})).status,404)});

test('Worker 匿名分享消费严格要求同源JSON且错误状态不泄露原因',async()=>{const e=env(),token='V'.repeat(43);let r=await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',body:{token},headers:{origin:'https://evil.test'}});assert.equal(r.status,403);r=await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',raw:JSON.stringify({token}),headers:{origin:'https://vault.test','content-type':'text/plain'}});assert.equal(r.status,415);r=await call(e,'/api/shares/consume',{method:'POST',body:{token}});assert.equal(r.status,404);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'share_unavailable'})});

const shareV2Manifest={version:2,iv:toB64(new Uint8Array(12).fill(3)),ciphertext:toB64(new Uint8Array(32).fill(4))},shareOwnerNote={version:1,iv:'N'.repeat(16),ciphertext:'b3duZXI='};
async function createShareV2(e,a,{token='S'.repeat(43),objects=[],maxViews=3,firstOpen=false,singleBrowser=false}={}){const headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},r=await call(e,'/api/shares/v2',{method:'POST',headers,body:{token,manifest:shareV2Manifest,ownerNote:shareOwnerNote,expiresAt:Date.now()+60000,maxViews,firstOpen,singleBrowser,objects}});assert.equal(r.status,201,await r.clone().text());return{headers,token,...await r.json()}}

test('Worker 认证创建v2无附件并commit，统一列表返回完整审计字段且可撤销',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'A'.repeat(43)});let r=await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/commit`,{method:'POST',headers:created.headers,body:{uploadToken:created.uploadToken}});assert.equal(r.status,200,await r.clone().text());r=await call(e,'/api/shares',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}});const row=(await r.json()).shares.find(x=>x.protocol===2);assert.deepEqual({...row,id:undefined,createdAt:undefined},{id:undefined,protocol:2,status:'active',ownerNote:shareOwnerNote,expiresAt:e.DB.secureSharePackages[0].expires_at,maxViews:3,viewCount:0,firstOpen:false,singleBrowser:false,firstOpenedAt:null,lastOpenedAt:null,revokedAt:null,createdAt:undefined});assert.notEqual(row.id,created.token);assert.ok(Number.isSafeInteger(row.createdAt));assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/${row.id}`,{method:'DELETE',headers:created.headers})).status,204);assert.ok(e.DB.secureSharePackages[0].revoked_at);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/shares/claim',{method:'POST',body:{token:created.token}})).status,404)});

test('Worker v2有附件上传重复请求fail-closed且不重复计费，未完整上传不可commit',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id1='B'.repeat(43),id2='C'.repeat(43),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'D'.repeat(43),objects:[{id:id1,size:4},{id:id2,size:3}]}),upload=(id,bytes)=>call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:bytes,headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':String(bytes.length),'x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}});let r=await upload(id1,new Uint8Array([1,2,3,4]));assert.equal(r.status,204,await r.clone().text());assert.equal(e.DB.storage,4);assert.equal(e.DB.usage[0].class_a,1);r=await upload(id1,new Uint8Array([1,2,3,4]));assert.equal(r.status,404);assert.equal(e.DB.storage,4);assert.equal(e.DB.usage[0].class_a,1);r=await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/commit`,{method:'POST',headers:created.headers,body:{uploadToken:created.uploadToken}});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.equal((await r.json()).error,'share_incomplete');assert.equal((await upload(id2,new Uint8Array([5,6,7]))).status,204);assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/commit`,{method:'POST',headers:created.headers,body:{uploadToken:created.uploadToken}})).status,200);assert.equal(e.DB.storage,7);assert.equal(e.DB.usage[0].class_a,2)});

test('Worker 并发上传同一分享对象时失败方不得删除成功方R2对象',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id='R'.repeat(43),bytes=new Uint8Array([1,2,3,4]),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'S'.repeat(43),objects:[{id,size:4}]}),upload=()=>call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:bytes,headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':'4','x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}});let first=true;e.ATTACHMENTS.onPut=async()=>{if(first){first=false;await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,40))}};const responses=await Promise.all([upload(),upload()]);assert.deepEqual(responses.map(r=>r.status).sort(),[204,404]);const row=e.DB.secureShareObjects[0];assert.ok(row.uploaded_at);assert.ok(e.ATTACHMENTS.objects.has(row.object_key),'成功提交并被D1引用的对象不得被失败请求补偿删除');assert.equal(e.DB.storage,4)});

test('Worker 分享 envelope 仅接受规范 Base64URL 与准确密文长度',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},base={token:'Q'.repeat(43),manifest:{version:2,iv:'M'.repeat(16),ciphertext:'manifest_ciphertext'},ownerNote:shareOwnerNote,expiresAt:Date.now()+60000,maxViews:1,firstOpen:false,singleBrowser:false,objects:[]};for(const manifest of [{...base.manifest,ciphertext:'A'},{...base.manifest,ciphertext:'AA'}]){const r=await call(e,'/api/shares/v2',{method:'POST',headers,body:{...base,token:crypto.randomUUID().replaceAll('-','').padEnd(43,'Q').slice(0,43),manifest}});assert.equal(r.status,400)}});

test('Worker v1与v2共享每用户20个活跃分享上限',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),userId=e.DB.users[0].id,now=Date.now();for(let i=0;i<20;i++)e.DB.secureShares.push({token_hash:`legacy-${i}`,user_id:userId,version:1,iv:'I'.repeat(16),ciphertext:'cipher',owner_note_version:1,owner_note_iv:'N'.repeat(16),owner_note_ciphertext:'bm90ZQ==',expires_at:now+60000,max_views:3,view_count:0,revoked_at:null,created_at:now});const headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},r=await call(e,'/api/shares/v2',{method:'POST',headers,body:{token:'L'.repeat(43),manifest:shareV2Manifest,ownerNote:shareOwnerNote,expiresAt:now+60000,maxViews:1,firstOpen:false,singleBrowser:false,objects:[]}});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.equal((await r.json()).error,'share_limit')});

test('Worker 分享上传D1失败且补偿删除失败时登记孤儿并保留物理配额',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id='J'.repeat(43),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'K'.repeat(43),objects:[{id,size:4}]});e.DB.failShareObjectUpdate=true;e.ATTACHMENTS.failDeleteCount=1;const r=await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:new Uint8Array(4),headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':'4','x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}});assert.equal(r.status,500);assert.equal(e.ATTACHMENTS.objects.size,1);assert.equal(e.DB.pendingR2Deletes.length,1);assert.equal(e.DB.storage,4)});
test('Worker 分享孤儿清理不把未提交对象行当有效引用',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id='O'.repeat(43),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'P'.repeat(43),objects:[{id,size:4}]});e.DB.failShareObjectUpdate=true;e.ATTACHMENTS.failDeleteCount=1;assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:new Uint8Array(4),headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':'4','x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}})).status,500);assert.equal(e.DB.pendingR2Deletes.length,1);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/session',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).status,200);assert.equal(e.DB.pendingR2Deletes.length,0);assert.equal(e.ATTACHMENTS.objects.size,0);assert.equal(e.DB.storage,0)});
test('Worker 分享存储预留失败后释放上传租约并允许重试',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id='U'.repeat(43),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'V'.repeat(43),objects:[{id,size:4}]}),upload=()=>call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:new Uint8Array(4),headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':'4','x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}});e.DB.attachments.push({object_key:'quota-fill',ciphertext_size:8*1024**3});assert.equal((await upload()).status,429);assert.equal(e.DB.secureShareObjects[0].upload_lease_token,null);e.DB.attachments=[];e.DB.storage=0;assert.equal((await upload()).status,204)});

test('Worker claim设置安全cookie，同cookie不重复消费并可下载对象',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),id='E'.repeat(43),bytes=new Uint8Array([9,8,7,6]),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:'F'.repeat(43),objects:[{id,size:bytes.length}],maxViews:1});assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/objects/${id}`,{method:'PUT',raw:bytes,headers:{...created.headers,'content-length':String(bytes.length),'x-share-upload-token':created.uploadToken}})).status,204);assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/commit`,{method:'POST',headers:created.headers,body:{uploadToken:created.uploadToken}})).status,200);let r=await call(e,'/api/shares/claim',{method:'POST',body:{token:created.token}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.deepEqual((await r.clone().json()).envelope,shareV2Manifest);const setCookie=r.headers.get('set-cookie');assert.match(setCookie,/^pv_share_session=.*; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict; Path=\/api\/shares;/);const cookie=setCookie.split(';')[0];assert.equal(e.DB.secureSharePackages[0].view_count,1);r=await call(e,'/api/shares/claim',{method:'POST',body:{token:created.token},headers:{cookie}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.equal(e.DB.secureSharePackages[0].view_count,1);r=await call(e,`/api/shares/objects/${id}`,{headers:{cookie}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.deepEqual(new Uint8Array(await r.arrayBuffer()),bytes);assert.equal(e.DB.usage[0].class_b,1)});

test('Worker firstOpen和singleBrowser在并发claim中只允许首个浏览器',async()=>{for(const flag of ['firstOpen','singleBrowser']){const e=env(),a=await login(e),created=await createShareV2(e,a,{token:(flag==='firstOpen'?'G':'H').repeat(43),maxViews:3,[flag]:true});assert.equal((await call(e,`/api/shares/v2/${created.token}/commit`,{method:'POST',headers:created.headers,body:{uploadToken:created.uploadToken}})).status,200);const rs=await Promise.all([call(e,'/api/shares/claim',{method:'POST',body:{token:created.token}}),call(e,'/api/shares/claim',{method:'POST',body:{token:created.token}})]);assert.deepEqual(rs.map(x=>x.status).sort(),[200,404],flag);assert.equal(e.DB.secureSharePackages[0].view_count,1);assert.equal(e.DB.secureShareSessions.length,1)}});

test('Worker 拒绝修改既有条目的资料类型',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},base={id:'immutable_type1',type:'custom',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'opaque-custom'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/immutable_type1',{method:'PUT',headers,body:base});assert.equal(r.status,200);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/immutable_type1',{method:'PUT',headers,body:{...base,type:'note',revision:1}});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'type_immutable'});assert.equal(e.DB.entries[0].type,'custom')});

test('Worker 客户端标记header不能绕过正文历史路径',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},base={id:'marker_entry',type:'note',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'base'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/marker_entry',{method:'PUT',headers,body:base});assert.equal(r.status,200);const before=e.DB.batchSizes.length;r=await call(e,'/api/entries/marker_entry',{method:'PUT',headers:{...headers,'x-vault-operation':'marker'},body:{...base,ciphertext:'edited-content',revision:1}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.equal((await r.json()).revision,2);assert.equal(e.DB.batchSizes.length,before)});

test('Worker 条目使用服务端 revision 拒绝两个页面的过期覆盖',async()=>{const e=env(),first=await login(e),secondLogin=await call(e,'/api/login',{method:'POST',body:{username:creds.username,password:creds.password}}),second=await secondLogin.json(),secondCookie=secondLogin.headers.get('set-cookie').split(';')[0],firstHeaders={cookie:first.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':first.json.csrf},secondHeaders={cookie:secondCookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':second.csrf},base={id:'conflict_entry',type:'note',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'base'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/conflict_entry',{method:'PUT',headers:firstHeaders,body:base});assert.equal(r.status,200);const created=await r.json();assert.equal(created.revision,1);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/conflict_entry',{method:'PUT',headers:firstHeaders,body:{...base,ciphertext:'first',revision:created.revision}});assert.equal(r.status,200);assert.equal((await r.json()).revision,2);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/conflict_entry',{method:'PUT',headers:secondHeaders,body:{...base,ciphertext:'second',revision:created.revision}});assert.equal(r.status,409);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'conflict',currentRevision:2});const stored=(await (await call(e,'/api/entries',{headers:{cookie:first.cookie}})).json()).items.find(item=>item.id==='conflict_entry');assert.equal(stored.ciphertext,'first');assert.equal(stored.revision,2)});

test('Worker 备份替换和永久删除重建后不复用 revision',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},base={id:'worker_aba',type:'note',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'old'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/worker_aba',{method:'PUT',headers,body:base});const stale=await r.json();assert.equal(stale.revision,1);const backup=await (await call(e,'/api/backup',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json();backup.envelopes[0].ciphertext='restored';assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/backup',{method:'PUT',headers,body:backup})).status,200);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/worker_aba',{method:'PUT',headers,body:{...base,ciphertext:'stale',revision:stale.revision}});assert.equal(r.status,409);let stored=(await (await call(e,'/api/entries',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json()).items[0];assert.equal(stored.ciphertext,'restored');assert.ok(stored.revision>stale.revision);assert.equal((await call(e,'/api/entries/worker_aba',{method:'DELETE',headers:{...headers,'if-match':String(stored.revision)}})).status,204);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/worker_aba',{method:'PUT',headers,body:{...base,ciphertext:'rebuilt'}});const rebuilt=await r.json();assert.ok(rebuilt.revision>stored.revision)});

test('Worker 条目创建时间由后端生成、列表返回且编辑不可改变',async()=>{const e=env(),a=await login(e),headers={cookie:a.cookie,origin:'https://vault.test','x-csrf-token':a.json.csrf},entry={id:'created_123',type:'note',version:1,iv:'opaque-iv',ciphertext:'opaque-ciphertext'};let r=await call(e,'/api/entries/created_123',{method:'PUT',headers,body:{...entry,createdAt:1}});assert.equal(r.status,400);r=await call(e,'/api/entries/created_123',{method:'PUT',headers,body:entry});const created=await r.json(),createdAt=created.createdAt;assert.equal(created.revision,1);assert.ok(Number.isSafeInteger(createdAt));await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,2));r=await call(e,'/api/entries/created_123',{method:'PUT',headers,body:{...entry,ciphertext:'edited',revision:1}});const edited=await r.json();assert.equal(edited.createdAt,createdAt);assert.equal(edited.revision,2);assert.equal((await (await call(e,'/api/entries',{headers:{cookie:a.cookie}})).json()).items[0].createdAt,createdAt)});
test('真实前端密钥对象可注册且旧字符串和畸形对象被拒绝',async()=>{for(const bad of [
  {...creds,kdf:JSON.stringify(creds.kdf)},
  {...creds,wrappedKey:JSON.stringify(creds.wrappedKey)},
  {...creds,kdf:{salt:'x',iterations:1}},
  {...creds,kdf:{salt:'x',iterations:310000,hash:'SHA-1'}},
  {...creds,wrappedKey:{iv:'x'}},
]){const e=env();const r=await call(e,'/api/register',{method:'POST',body:bad});assert.equal(r.status,400);assert.deepEqual(await r.json(),{error:'invalid'})}});
